  "content": "<p>有了這個模組，您將獲得七種攻城器械：迫擊砲、投石車、弩炮、攻城槌、巨型投石機、長管炮和攻城梯。每種載具都有逼真的音效和動畫，充分傳達了中世紀戰鬥的氛圍。</p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">使用方式<br></span>按 'I' 開啟機器的物品欄，按 'F' 使用機器，使用彈藥物品對機器點擊右鍵即可裝填。</p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">相容性<br></span><strong>村莊傭兵(Villager Recruits)</strong>：查看讓傭兵能夠使用攻城器械的專案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits-medieval-siege-machine-mod-compat-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Recruits - 中世紀攻城器械模組相容擴充</a></p><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">加入 Discord</span></h3><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jLgF2Sp/discord-new-2021-logo-45-D326-F28-C-seeklogo-com.jpg\" alt=\"Discord 按鈕\"></a></p><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">安裝說明</span></h3><h1>請確認您已安裝最新版本的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a>，若您正在遊玩 1.21.1 版本，還需安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></h1><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">截圖展示</span></h3><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Vv6P9Vy/2022-03-04-21-08-02.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Kh5wC4C/battering-ram.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qpQ0dgs/2022-03-04-21-08-35.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cJH2nm2/icon.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/5MQH3fW/logo.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vQ886Xz/culverin.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/N9J2Kgg/2023-09-21-13-45-26.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">合成配方</span></h3><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ZcFNbVr/siege-workbench.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"966\"></span></strong></p><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">致謝</span></h3><ul>\n<li>Lexiolty 製作了攻城器械的模型與材質。</li>\n<li>Goodbird 將其移植至 1.20.1 版本。</li>\n<li>Haiaiel 將其移植至 Fabric 1.21.1 版本。</li>\n</ul>",
